<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.160 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian 13-week T-note yields 5.160 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia said the result of this week's T-note tender was as follows:</p>
<p> 13-week -    Amount	Av. yield  Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS700 million   5.260	5.16 only   5.230 (June 25)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 100)</p>
<p> 26-week -    Amount	Av. yield  Range	 Previous</p>
<p>		  AS300 million   5.113	5.10-5.13   5.216 (June 18)</p>
<p>		  (RBA take-up nil, pct allotted at top 33)</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
